# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ViralCut — repository hygiene
#
# Rule #1: SOURCE AND RENDERED MEDIA NEVER ENTER GIT.
# Media files are large, often third-party owned, and are the single most
# common cause of DMCA strikes / repository flags / account suspension.
# This repository ships CODE ONLY. See docs/COMPLIANCE.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Media (never commit) --------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.avi
*.webm
*.m4v
*.flv
*.ts
*.m2ts
*.wmv
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.ogg
*.opus
*.gif

# --- Working directories ---------------------------------------------------
downloads/
sources/
exports/
renders/
work/
tmp/
.cache/
*.tmp

# Keep folder placeholders only
!**/.gitkeep

# --- The one exception: deliverables/ --------------------------------------
# Finished masters that are cleared for redistribution (public-domain or
# self-shot footage, licence-cleared audio) may be committed here, because the
# sandbox has no other way to hand a file to the user: uploads.github.com is
# blocked, so release assets fail, and ignored paths are invisible in the file
# browser. See deliverables/README.md for the two conditions. Studio footage
# and commercial tracks still never enter git.
!deliverables/
!deliverables/**

# --- Large images / exported frames ---------------------------------------
frames/
thumbnails/
*.psd
*.tif
*.tiff

# ...but allow small documentation images and generated brand assets
!docs/img/*.png
!docs/img/*.jpg

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
build/
dist/

# --- Secrets / credentials (never commit) ----------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
cookies.txt
*cookies*.txt
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
token*.json

# --- OS / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
